      "message": "@vamsimulpuri@google.com\n\nIs there any specific reason for not doing fsync after SETATTR?\n\nLet\u0027s consider a situation where we change access mode before the reboot and it is not flushed on the disk by the filesystem, after failover the access mode will be reverted to previous value.",
